    "effective_from_basis": "No effective dates on the page: effective_from is the Monday 00:00 UTC starting the 13-week Insights window before the first fetch, 2026-10-21. gpt-5.6-sol is promotional through 2026-11-21 (effective_until). A '-' write is priced at input.",
    "source_notes": "Page and script bytes change on every site build, so content_sha256 (the page as fetched) describes this fetch, not the price facts. The facts are the entries, which table_id digests. Rates above 272K are in https://developers.openai.com/_astro/pricing.BRxkzBWq.js (sha256 4b01a03c6bc038e906e57a390ac2c37a135994ae83df7b1216eb04835db434d0), fetched 10:54:49Z; its URL changes per build too. The tier labels are in PricingContextSelector.react.Bav9OpW6.js, which PricingContextSelector.react.DfR41lUi.js loads. The owner-review refetch at retrieved_at found every rate unchanged from the first fetch, 2026-10-21T15:16:38Z."
